{
	"name": "Bi-Way: appointment reply",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Appointment reply\nHandles the answers to **Appointment reminder**: a tapped button (`CONFIRM`, `CANCEL`, `CALL_ME`) or a typed YES / NO on SMS. Updates the sheet, answers the customer and tells your team.\n\n### Setup\n1. Same **Bi-Way API** credential and Google Sheet as **Appointment reminder** (replace `YOUR_SHEET_ID`).\n2. An SMTP credential for the emails to your team; replace `team@example.com`.\n3. Your n8n must be reachable over HTTPS, then publish the workflow: the trigger registers its webhook on Bi-Way by itself.",
				"height": 300,
				"width": 500,
				"color": 4
			},
			"id": "90c2962f-569e-4697-a5d2-5be9dc7c1d59",
